[239.660996, "o", "error: invalid option: --no-pager\u001b[m\r\nusage: git diff [<options>] [<commit>] [--] [<path>...]\u001b[m\r\n   or: git diff [<options>] --cached [--merge-base] [<commit>] [--] [<path>...]\u001b[m\r\n   or: git diff [<options>] [--merge-base] <commit> [<commit>...] <commit> [--] [<path>...]\u001b[m\r\n   or: git diff [<options>] <commit>...<commit> [--] [<path>...]\u001b[m\r\n   or: git diff [<options>] <blob> <blob>\u001b[m\r\n   or: git diff [<options>] --no-index [--] <path> <path>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[m\r\ncommon diff options:\u001b[m\r\n  -z            output diff-raw with lines terminated with NUL.\u001b[m\r\n  -p            output patch format.\u001b[m\r\n  -u            synonym for -p.\u001b[m\r\n  --patch-with-raw\u001b[m\r\n                output both a patch and the diff-raw format.\u001b[m\r\n  --stat        show diffstat instead of patch.\u001b[m\r\n  --numstat     show numeric diffstat instead of patch.\u001b[m\r\n  --patch-with-stat\u001b[m\r\n                output a patch and prepend its diffstat.\u001b[m\r\n  --name-only   show only names of changed files.\u001b[m\r\n  --name-status show names and status of changed files.\u001b[m\r\n  --full-index  show full object name on index lines.\u001b[m\r\n  --abbrev=<n>  abbreviate object names in diff-tree header and diff-raw.\u001b[m\r\n  -R            swap input file pairs.\u001b[m\r\n  -B            detect complete rewrites.\u001b[m\r\n  -M            detect renames.\u001b[m\r\n  -C            detect copies.\u001b[m\r\n  --find-copies-harder\u001b[m\r\n                try unchanged files as candidate for copy detection.\u001b[m\r\n  -l<n>         limit rename attempts up to <n> paths.\u001b[m\r\n  -O<file>      reorder diffs according to the <file>.\u001b[m\r\n  -S<string>    find filepair whose only one side contains the string.\u001b[m\r\n  --pickaxe-all\u001b[m\r\n                show all files diff when -S is used and hit is found.\u001b[m\r\n  -a  --text    treat all files as text.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[m\r\n"]
